    <string name="empty_title">No stickers yet</string>
    <string name="empty_body">The stickers you create or save on TikTok while scrolling stay locked inside TikTok: Whatik pulls them out of a screen recording or a link, converts them to WhatsApp\'s format and adds them as packs, one at a time or in bulk.</string>
    <string name="empty_step1">Open TikTok and record the screen while the sticker is visible (in the video or in the sticker panel). For a still sticker a screenshot is enough.</string>
    <string name="empty_step2">In Whatik choose "From a screen recording" (or share the video with Whatik): moving stickers are detected on their own, with box and loop length already worked out. Press "Create all" and they are in the library.</string>
    <string name="empty_step3">Got a direct link to a sticker (.awebp/.webp/.gif file) or to a page containing it? Use "From a link". Images already in the gallery are found by the automatic search.</string>
    <string name="empty_step4">Tap stickers to select them (or "Select all") and press "Copy to WhatsApp": packs are created and opened in WhatsApp (3 to 30 stickers per pack).</string>
